# Street preacher in the corporate district. Terra Vitae hint. Flags: cassius_blessed
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: (He does not stop preaching, he only turns to face you.)
+ They call it cleansing. I call it what it is: the wall is a graveyard with a gate in it.
#
o_text: Who are "they"?
o_id: cassius_who
o_goto: Who
#
o_text: Where do you people meet?
o_id: cassius_where
o_goto: Where
#
o_text: Keep preaching.
o_id: cassius_leave
o_goto: End

name: Who
npc: Eschaton. White coats, green badges. They decide who is clean enough for tomorrow.
+ The corpses at the south wall are their paperwork.
#
o_text: (Back)
o_id: who_back
o_goto: Default

name: Where
npc: Terra Vitae. West side, up the stairs. Father Olaf pours; Nova speaks. Bring nothing, they feed you anyway.
effect: SetFlag('KnowsAboutTerraVitae')
#
o_text: (Back)
o_id: where_back
o_goto: Default

name: End
npc: Walk in the light, or at least out of the traffic.
effect: EndConversation
